### GET all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### GET contact by id
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/6a088239f46dc243785824e8

### Create contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "johndoe@test.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "1990-01-01"
}

### Update contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/6a088239f46dc243785824e8 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Jane",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "janedoe@test.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Green",
    "birthday": "1992-02-02"
}

### DELETE contact
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/6a08823ff46dc243785824e9 HTTP/1.1